# MUST_FAIL: RED FIXTURE (UXD-05, attempt 3) — a PARENT rename carrying a further as: chain
# MUST_FAIL: a PARENT rename resolves in the pipe, Kernel.apply and :erlang.apply shapes too
# MUST_FAIL: a PARENT rename resolves regardless of declaration order
# MUST_FAIL: an alias declared INSIDE a function body is resolved, not only a module-top alias
# MUST_FAIL: spawn_lock_violations/2 flips on the parent-rename fixture path (refutable)
diff --git a/samen_core/lib/mix/tasks/samen.verify.agent_coverage.ex b/samen_core/lib/mix/tasks/samen.verify.agent_coverage.ex
--- a/samen_core/lib/mix/tasks/samen.verify.agent_coverage.ex
